control: A hand-over from a unit of work that started before the loader adopted a value someone else stored is discarded
removes: backfill hands its token over with no adoption stamp, so a unit of work that took its source before the loader adopted the operator's credential writes its own over it
packages: ./worker/internal/backfill
tests: TestAHandOverFromBeforeAnAdoptionLeavesTheOperatorsCredential
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

